## Pattern Avanzati per Futuri Sviluppi

### Sistema Caching API Avanzato

**PATTERN CACHE MULTI-LIVELLO**:
```php
// Cache con invalidazione intelligente
class ApiCacheService
{
    public static function getCachedData($key, $callback, $duration = 3600, $tags = [])
    {
        $cache = Yii::$app->cache;
        $data = $cache->get($key);
        
        if ($data === false) {
            $data = $callback();
            $cache->set($key, $data, $duration, new TagDependency(['tags' => $tags]));
            
            // Log cache miss per ottimizzazioni
            Yii::info("Cache MISS for key: $key", 'api.cache');
        } else {
            Yii::info("Cache HIT for key: $key", 'api.cache');
        }
        
        return $data;
    }
    
    public static function invalidateByTags($tags)
    {
        TagDependency::invalidate(Yii::$app->cache, $tags);
        Yii::info("Cache invalidated for tags: " . implode(', ', $tags), 'api.cache');
    }
}

// Utilizzo nel controller
public function actionTypes()
{
    $cacheKey = 'request_types_api_' . Yii::$app->user->id;
    $cacheTags = ['request_types', 'user_' . Yii::$app->user->id];
    
    $requestTypes = ApiCacheService::getCachedData(
        $cacheKey,
        function() {
            return RequestType::getForApi();
        },
        1800, // 30 minuti
        $cacheTags
    );
    
    return [
        'success' => true,
        'data' => $requestTypes,
        'meta' => [
            'cached' => true,
            'cache_key' => $cacheKey
        ]
    ];
}
```

